Package: SVclust
Title: Support Vector Clustering Algorithm Package
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Lucas", "Scheffer", , "lucasscheffer2001@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Anderson", "Ara", , "ara@ufpr.br", role = c("aut", "ths")))
Description: This package provides an implementation of the Support Vector
    Clustering (SVC) algorithm. SVC maps data to a high-dimensional
    feature space using a kernel function, determines the minimal
    enclosing hypersphere, and identifies clusters by checking
    connectivity paths within this sphere. It offers features like
    automatic tuning of the gamma parameter and efficient handling of
    large datasets by applying SVC to a subset and classifying remaining
    points with a Support Vector Machine.
